I don't think that there can be any LOGICAL reason for mimics to disappear
when you leave the room. People do not scrutinise everything close up--
it it looks like a chest, you presume that it is a chest and remember it
that way.

Sure, it's a nice cheat in Nethack, and I use it all the time. I also
rob shops by chipping a hole in the wall, standing in it, and kicking
everything to the space in front of the door. However, I would not complain
if the dev team eliminated both of these cheats, and made the game even
more challenging. If you want to win easily, play in wizard mode :-)


